# QLD Fuel Finder - Environment Variables
#
# To get a live API token:
# 1. Go to https://fuelpricesqld.com.au
# 2. Register as a "Data Consumer"
# 3. Accept the Terms of Service
# 4. You'll receive your SubscriberToken via email
#
# Copy this file to .env and add your token:
#   cp .env.example .env
#
# Without a token, the app falls back to monthly CKAN data (still works, just not real-time)

VITE_FPQ_TOKEN=<your-fpq-subscriber-token>